WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.660
I'm Sathian, a dad and startup
founder

00:00:02.660 --> 00:00:05.560
building the Tooth Fairy network
in public.

00:00:06.140 --> 00:00:09.300
Childhood is full of little
moments that

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:10.400
deserve to last.

00:00:11.080 --> 00:00:13.760
Between visits with my
daughters, a wobbly

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:14.880
tooth could disappear.

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:17.400
The tooth fairy had been, and
I'd

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:18.060
miss the moment.

00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:20.940
As a divorced dad of two, I

00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:22.300
know you don't have to share a

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:23.720
home to want to be part of

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:24.240
those moments.

00:00:25.260 --> 00:00:27.840
Satoshi Nakamoto's work inspired
me to think

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:30.040
about open networks and what it
means

00:00:30.040 --> 00:00:31.380
to own something yourself.

00:00:32.260 --> 00:00:34.300
It starts with a lost tooth, a

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.340
proof booklet for your child,
and a

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:38.360
parent -controlled digital
wallet you can hand

00:00:38.360 --> 00:00:40.420
over when they're ready.

00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:46.780
Managed by their parent, the
story lives

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:48.320
in a small book we call the

00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:48.600
proof.

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:51.800
The gift gives families a way to

00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:55.560
talk about saving, ownership,
and looking after

00:00:55.560 --> 00:00:56.660
something for the future.

00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:02.260
It starts with digital dollars,
Bitcoin or

00:01:02.260 --> 00:01:02.760
Solana.

00:01:03.440 --> 00:01:06.260
As children add drawings and
celebrate milestones,

00:01:07.120 --> 00:01:08.820
family can add their own
contributions.

00:01:09.780 --> 00:01:11.880
The memories stay with them and
so

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:12.620
does the support.

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:15.360
I use it with my own children.

00:01:15.740 --> 00:01:18.160
Early tests with friends and
family have

00:01:18.160 --> 00:01:18.800
been encouraging.

00:01:19.560 --> 00:01:20.980
Now I'd like to build it with

00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:21.740
more families.

